  <p class="sbb-text-xl sbb-lead-container-lead-text">
    Lyne is the design system for web applications at SBB. It provides ready-made, tested and accessible UI building blocks
    that help teams develop high-quality applications faster.
  </p>
</sbb-lead-container>

<sbb-container background-expanded color="milk" class="lp-container no-margin-top">
  <sbb-title level="2" visual-level="2">What does Lyne do for my product?</sbb-title>
  <div class="sbb-grid-only lp-flipcards">
    <sbb-flip-card class="lp-flip-card-1">
      <sbb-flip-card-summary image-alignment="after">
        <sbb-title level="4">Faster product development.</sbb-title>
        <img slot="image" src="/assets/images/lyne/illustrations/schnellere_produktentwicklung_de.webp" alt="">
      </sbb-flip-card-summary>
      <sbb-flip-card-details>
        <sbb-title level="4" negative>Faster product development.</sbb-title>
        Ready-made, documented components and clear design guidelines considerably speed up the development of new products. Teams do not have to design recurring elements such as buttons, forms or navigation from scratch every time and can focus on what really sets their product apart. Themes adapt the UI to its purpose – compact for data-rich interfaces or with neutral colours for industry applications.
      </sbb-flip-card-details>
    </sbb-flip-card>
    <sbb-flip-card class="lp-flip-card-2">
      <sbb-flip-card-summary image-alignment="below">
        <sbb-title level="4">Higher product quality.</sbb-title>
        <img slot="image" src="/assets/images/lyne/illustrations/hoehere_proeduktqualitaet_de.webp" alt="">
      </sbb-flip-card-summary>
      <sbb-flip-card-details>
        <sbb-title level="4" negative>Higher product quality.</sbb-title>
        Carefully tested and maintained components ensure a consistently high level of quality across all applications. Accessibility is built in from the start – this is how we make sure that our digital services meet the WCAG standards and are accessible to all users. And with the included dark mode, applications look pleasant and well thought out in any environment.
      </sbb-flip-card-details>
    </sbb-flip-card>
    <sbb-flip-card class="lp-flip-card-3">
      <sbb-flip-card-summary image-alignment="below">
        <sbb-title level="4">Future-proof technology.</sbb-title>
        <img slot="image" src="/assets/images/lyne/illustrations/zukunftssichere_technologie.webp" alt="">
      </sbb-flip-card-summary>
      <sbb-flip-card-details>
        <sbb-title level="4" negative>Future-proof technology.</sbb-title>
        With web components, we rely on an open web standard standardised by the W3C that works independently of individual frameworks. This makes our components maintainable in the long term and usable in any technological environment – today and in ten years.
      </sbb-flip-card-details>
    </sbb-flip-card>
    <sbb-flip-card class="lp-flip-card-4">
      <sbb-flip-card-summary image-alignment="below">
        <sbb-title level="4">Consistent user experience & brand.</sbb-title>
        <img slot="image" src="/assets/images/lyne/illustrations/konsistente_ux_und_marke.webp" alt="">
      </sbb-flip-card-summary>
      <sbb-flip-card-details>
        <sbb-title level="4" negative>Consistent brand.</sbb-title>
        Consistent design, language and interaction patterns across all digital touchpoints create a recognisable and uniform experience. Customers and employees immediately find their way around every SBB application – this builds trust and strengthens the brand in the long term.
      </sbb-flip-card-details>
    </sbb-flip-card>
  </div>
</sbb-container>

